        "description": "Historical Report Analysis Tool\n\nUse this tool whenever the user asks questions about a specific report stored in OneDrive.\n\nThis tool retrieves the requested report, analyzes its contents, and answers the user's question using the report data.\n\nRequired Inputs:\n\n* report_name: Exact report filename without the extension.\n* question: User's question about the report.\n\nExamples:\n\n* Analyze PlacementReport_FebtoMay\n* What are the key trends in PlacementReport_MartoJun?\n* Which category performed best in PlacementReport_FebtoMay?\n* Summarize PlacementReport_MartoApril\n* What improvements were observed in PlacementReport_MartoJun?\n\nAlways use this tool when:\n\n* A report name is mentioned.\n* The user wants analysis of a previous report.\n* The user asks about trends, growth, decline, top performers, comparisons, recommendations, or insights from a specific report.\n\nPass both the exact report name and the user's question to the tool.\n",
